{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 2 från S, V, MP.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 2 by S, V, MP.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Research Freedom and Scientific Quality", "dok_titel": "Research", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2022/23:1026 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) items 2 and 8,\n\n2022/23:2082 by Louise Meijer et al. (M) items 13, 15 and 16,\n\n2022/23:2126 by Boriana Åberg (M) items 1 and 2, and\n\n2022/23:2132 by Åsa Westlund et al. (S) item 12.", "notis": "The Riksdag has addressed approximately 80 proposals on research in motions from the general motion period of 2022. The Riksdag rejected all proposals, among other reasons because work is ongoing or measures have already been taken.\nThe proposals concern, for example, the allocation of research funds, research freedom, and scientific quality.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2022/23:1026 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) items 2 and 8,\n\n2022/23:2082 by Louise Meijer et al. (M) items 13, 15 and 16,\n\n2022/23:2126 by Boriana Åberg (M) items 1 and 2, and\n\n2022/23:2132 by Åsa Westlund et al. (S) item 12.", "Reservation 2"]}, "votering_id": "4F50F2C3-7870-456E-BD04-272CB610E8DF", "rm": "2022/23", "beteckning": "UbU11", "punkt": 2, "dok_id": "HA01UbU11", "datum": "2023-06-14", "utskott": "UbU", "rubrik": "Forskningens frihet och vetenskaplig kvalitet", "dok_titel": "Forskning", "sammanfattning": "Utbildningsutskottet har behandlat cirka 80 förslag om forskning i motioner från den allmänna motionstiden 2022. Utskottet föreslår att riksdagen ska säga nej till 